---
// HTML 详情模板（系列参数表等）：内容块由 lib/tpl-html.mjs 解析，统一用网站样式渲染；当前型号整列高亮
import { tplHtmlBlocks, modelKey } from '../lib/tpl-html.mjs';
interface Props { html: string; model: string; lang: string }
const { html, model, lang } = Astro.props;
const blocks = tplHtmlBlocks(html);
const me = modelKey(model);
const L = {
  en: { series: 'Series specifications', swipe: '← Swipe to see all models →' },
  es: { series: 'Especificaciones de la serie', swipe: '← Deslice para ver todos los modelos →' },
  ru: { series: 'Характеристики серии', swipe: '← Проведите, чтобы увидеть все модели →' },
}[lang] || { series: 'Series specifications', swipe: '' };
const hasTable = blocks.some((b) => b.t === 'table' || b.t === 'grid');
const firstTitle = blocks.find((b) => b.t === 'title');
const heading = hasTable ? L.series : (firstTitle ? firstTitle.text : L.series);
const shown = hasTable ? blocks : blocks.filter((b) => b !== firstTitle);
---
{blocks.length > 0 && (
  <section class="card series-html">
    <h2>{heading}</h2>
    {shown.map((b) => {
      if (b.t === 'eyebrow') return <p class="sh-eyebrow">{b.text}</p>;
      if (b.t === 'title') return <p class="sh-title">{b.text}</p>;
      if (b.t === 'sub') return <p class="sh-sub">{b.text}</p>;
      if (b.t === 'cards') return (
        <div class="sh-cards" style={`--n:${Math.min(b.items.length, 4)}`}>
          {b.items.map((lines) => (
            <div class:list={['sh-card', { cur: me && modelKey(lines[0]) === me }]}>
              <b>{lines[0]}</b>
              {lines[1] && <span class="sh-cp">{lines[1]}</span>}
              {lines.slice(2).map((l) => <span class="sh-ck">{l}</span>)}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      );
      if (b.t === 'h') return <h3>{b.text}</h3>;
      if (b.t === 'p') return <p class="sh-p">{b.text}</p>;
      if (b.t === 'hi') return <div class="sh-hi">{b.items.map((x) => <span>{x}</span>)}</div>;
      if (b.t === 'chips') return <ul class="sh-apps">{b.items.map((x) => <li>{x}</li>)}</ul>;
      if (b.t === 'list') return <ul class="sh-list">{b.items.map((x) => <li>{x}</li>)}</ul>;
      if (b.t === 'grid') return (
        <div class="tbl-scroll"><table class="plain"><tbody>
          {b.rows.map((cells) => <tr>{cells.map((c) => c.th
            ? <th colspan={c.cs > 1 ? c.cs : undefined} rowspan={c.rs > 1 ? c.rs : undefined}>{c.text}</th>
            : <td colspan={c.cs > 1 ? c.cs : undefined} rowspan={c.rs > 1 ? c.rs : undefined}>{c.text}</td>)}</tr>)}
        </tbody></table></div>
      );
      // 型号表：每个数据列属于哪个型号（cols）；当前型号可能占好几列（同型号不同电池节数），这些列一起高亮
      const cols = Array.isArray(b.cols) && b.cols.length ? b.cols : b.models.map((m) => ({ m }));
      const n = cols.length;
      const curCols = new Set(cols.map((c, i) => (me && modelKey(c.m) === me ? i : -1)).filter((i) => i >= 0));
      const isCur = (col, cs) => cs >= 1 && [...Array(cs).keys()].every((k) => curCols.has(col + k));
      const cur = curCols.size === 1 ? [...curCols][0] : -1;
      return (
        <>
          {n > 3 && <p class="scroll-hint">{L.swipe}</p>}
          <div class="tbl-scroll" data-sh-scroll>
            <table style={`min-width:${Math.max(560, 170 + n * 105)}px`}>
              {b.heads ? (
                <thead>{b.heads.map((row, r) => (
                  <tr class:list={[{ sub: r > 0 }]}>
                    {r === 0 && <th class="stk lbl-h" rowspan={b.heads.length}>{b.corner}</th>}
                    {row.map((h) => <th colspan={h.cs > 1 ? h.cs : undefined} rowspan={h.rs > 1 ? h.rs : undefined} class:list={[{ cur: isCur(h.col, h.cs) }]}>{h.text}</th>)}
                  </tr>
                ))}</thead>
              ) : (
                <thead><tr>
                  <th class="stk lbl-h">{b.corner}</th>
                  {b.models.map((m, i) => <th class:list={[{ cur: i === cur }]}>{m}</th>)}
                </tr></thead>
              )}
              <tbody>
                {b.rows.map((r) => r.sec !== undefined
                  ? <tr class="sec"><td class="stk">{r.sec}</td><td colspan={n}></td></tr>
                  : <tr><td class="lbl stk">{r.label}</td>{r.cells.map((c) => (
                      <td colspan={c.cs > 1 ? c.cs : undefined} rowspan={c.rs > 1 ? c.rs : undefined}
                        class:list={[{ cur: isCur(c.col, c.cs), span: c.cs > 1 }]}>{c.cs > 1 ? <span class="sv">{c.text}</span> : c.text}</td>
                    ))}</tr>)}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </>
      );
    })}
  </section>
)}

<script is:inline>
// 手机上表格放不下时，自动滑到当前型号那一列
(function () {
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-sh-scroll]').forEach(function (box) {
    var th = box.querySelector('thead th.cur'), stk = box.querySelector('thead th.stk');
    if (!th || box.scrollWidth <= box.clientWidth) return;
    var x = th.offsetLeft - (stk ? stk.offsetWidth : 0) - 8;
    if (x > 0) box.scrollLeft = x;
  });
})();
</script>

<style>
  .series-html { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; min-width: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .series-html { padding: 16px; } }
  .series-html h2 { font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .series-html .sh-title { font: 600 20px var(--display); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .02em; margin: -4px 0 12px; }
  .series-html .sh-eyebrow { font: 600 11.5px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .series-html .sh-eyebrow + .sh-title { margin-top: 0; }
  .series-html .sh-title:has(+ .sh-sub) { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .series-html .sh-sub { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .series-html .sh-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--n), minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; margin: 16px 0 6px; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .series-html .sh-cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(100px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; } .series-html .sh-card { padding: 10px; } .series-html .sh-card b { font-size: 16px; } .series-html .sh-card .sh-cp { font-size: 12px; } .series-html .sh-card .sh-ck { font-size: 11.5px; } }
  .series-html .sh-card { display: grid; gap: 2px; align-content: start; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; background: #fff; }
  .series-html .sh-card b { font: 700 18px/1.15 var(--display); }
  .series-html .sh-card .sh-cp { font: 600 13.5px var(--mono); color: var(--ink); }
  .series-html .sh-card .sh-ck { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  .series-html .sh-card.cur { border-top-color: var(--accent); background: rgba(15, 107, 92, .05); }
  .series-html .sh-card.cur .sh-cp { color: var(--accent); }
  .tbl-scroll thead tr.sub th { background: #2b3a36; font-weight: 500; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .tbl-scroll thead tr.sub th.cur { background: #13806e; }
  .series-html .sh-hi { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .series-html .sh-hi span { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 99px; padding: 4px 11px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; background: #fff; }
  .series-html .sh-hi span:first-child { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; border-color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--mono); }
  .series-html h3 { font: 600 12px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--muted); margin: 18px 0 8px; }
  .series-html .sh-apps { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .series-html .sh-apps li { background: var(--ok-soft); color: var(--ok); border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px 10px; font-size: 13px; }
  .series-html .sh-list { margin: 0 0 8px; padding: 0; list-style: none; font-size: 14px; display: grid; gap: 6px; }
  .series-html .sh-list li { position: relative; padding-left: 20px; }
  .series-html .sh-list li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 4px; top: .55em; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); }
  .series-html .sh-p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin: 10px 0 0; }
  .scroll-hint { display: none; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .tbl-scroll { position: relative; overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .tbl-scroll table { border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; width: 100%; font-size: 13px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .tbl-scroll th, .tbl-scroll td { padding: 9px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); border-right: 1px solid #edf1ef; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; }
  .tbl-scroll tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
  .tbl-scroll thead th { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
  .tbl-scroll thead th.cur { background: var(--accent); }
  .tbl-scroll thead th.lbl-h { text-align: left; }
  .tbl-scroll tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #f8faf9; }
  .tbl-scroll td.lbl { text-align: left; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; }
  .tbl-scroll tr.sec td { background: #eef3f1 !important; color: var(--ink); font: 600 12px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; text-align: left; }
  .tbl-scroll td.cur { background: rgba(15, 107, 92, .07) !important; font-weight: 600; }
  .tbl-scroll .stk { position: sticky; left: 0; z-index: 2; background: #fff; box-shadow: 1px 0 0 var(--line); min-width: 140px; max-width: 200px; }
  .tbl-scroll tbody tr:nth-child(even) .stk { background: #f8faf9; }
  .tbl-scroll thead .stk { z-index: 3; background: var(--ink); }
  .tbl-scroll table.plain { min-width: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .scroll-hint { display: block; }
    .tbl-scroll td.span { text-align: left; }
    /* 合并单元格的文字跟着滑动停在参数名右边，滑到哪一列都能看到 */
    .tbl-scroll td.span .sv { position: sticky; left: 140px; display: inline-block; max-width: calc(100vw - 230px); }
    .tbl-scroll .stk { width: 130px; min-width: 130px; max-width: 130px; }
  }
</style>
